<title>POLAND: KGHM JULY NET RISES TO PLN 60.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>KGHM JULY NET RISES TO PLN 60.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997	    1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    60.58   vs    15.84</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit     120.85   vs    27.03</p>
<p> Operating profit   124.68   vs    17.05</p>
<p> Sales		  379.33   vs   238.84</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997	  1996</p>
<p> Net profit	   324.74   vs   232.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit     688.66   vs   429.57</p>
<p> Operating profit   690.00   vs   391.03</p>
<p> Sales		1,944.83   vs 2,456.65</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish copper concern is KGHM Polska</p>
<p>Miedz SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
